# ==============================================================================
# NEXUS NUMERICAL COMPUTING LIBRARY (numpy) — PUBLIC ENTRY POINT
# ==============================================================================
# Usage:
#   import numpy
#
# Provides multidimensional NdArray storage, constructors, indexing, slicing,
# zero-copy views, N-D broadcasting, element-wise arithmetic, mathematical
# functions, compensated reductions, linear algebra (LU, QR, solve, inv, det,
# lstsq, eigenvalues, SVD), reproducible PRNG, sorting/searching, statistics,
# and binary/CSV serialization.
#
# Completely independent of Aether / graphical libraries.
# ==============================================================================

